crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f54f2e6e79f2b09f83f0a6e4adc174ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art style. I would like an artwork of my friend and me. We are best friends who play games together and love cute things! I leave the pose up to you.\n\nReferences here:\nMilky the Strawberry Cow Girl\nMilky is a cheeky cow girl who loves all things Y2K and being with her friends!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wqvdt4BA2sjTmV_1umRjQvTPeBqzvUqv\n\nPurin the Bear Girl\nPurin is a flirty gyaru big sister! She likes pompompurin, yellow pikmin and korilakkuma!\nshe loves to go shopping, doing her makeup and handicrafts <33\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1i4nVcWZsl_5steVosAoyThHe8hXyxlez/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@t0kina_reimu/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b86e95c2/uploads/origins/0136d5d5-a591-4dd1-8f25-ba0cb3ab7ac7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=baa01a2dd58cf226705c92e05a119097", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b86e95c2/uploads/origins/0136d5d5-a591-4dd1-8f25-ba0cb3ab7ac7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=baa01a2dd58cf226705c92e05a119097, https://si.imgix.net/b86e95c2/uploads/origins/0136d5d5-a591-4dd1-8f25-ba0cb3ab7ac7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eec040d0491ab88f4ef4d9056bd2f9e6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b86e95c2/uploads/origins/0136d5d5-a591-4dd1-8f25-ba0cb3ab7ac7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=262e52b232a1818d5639996b01d1d